# vAPI - Endpoints Recon

Target: http://localhost:8000/vapi/
Explored via: Postman (vAPI collection + vAPI_ENV)

| Folder | OWASP Category | Endpoints |
|---|---|---|
| API1 | BOLA | POST Create User, GET Get User, PUT Update User |
| API2 | Broken User Authentication | POST User Login, GET Get Details |
| API3 | Excessive Data Exposure | POST Create User |
| API4 | Lack of Resources & Rate Limiting | POST Mobile Login, POST Verify OTP, GET Get Details |
| API5 | Broken Function Level Authorization | POST Create User, GET Get User |
| API6 | Mass Assignment | POST Create User, GET Get User |
| API7 | Security Misconfiguration | POST Create User, GET User Login, GET Get Key, GET User Logout |
| API8 | Injection | POST User Login, GET Get Secret |
| API9 | Improper Assets Management | v2 (sub-folder) |
| API10 | Insufficient Logging & Monitoring | GET Get Flag |

Starting point for testing: API1 (BOLA) — matches directly with my API testing background.


